<concept id="t00085">
	<title>Power tailgate opening speed</title>
	<conbody>
		<p>To adjust the power tailgate speed, select <menucascade><uicontrol>Setup</uicontrol><uicontrol>Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Door</uicontrol><uicontrol>Power tailgate opening speed</uicontrol><uicontrol>Normal/Fast</uicontrol></menucascade> in the infotainment system. (The default setting is <uicontrol>Fast</uicontrol>.)</p>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00084.dita#t00084" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Setting the power tailgate</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</concept>